ense PK battles up close on the big virtual screen for a comprehensively upgraded interactive experience.", "short_description": "Douyin VR Live is a next-generation VR user-facing streaming platform that is committed to bringing you an exhilarating and immersive interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logozh.png", "id": "1439261319980082", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75441583_1439261323313415_6105103478412624436_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qStM81f_YrEQ7kNvwHB4Fy-&_nc_oc=AdnTyostuBMpKGYztpeQAaninRicD5XZcaOh3wxjYsMNBkaVdHZdQbJsu3MhXulcx9k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfupWlLsQMzeooCAv_6fI4NhFBk_UVDn4mrFvytd03DYkA&oe=699C671C"}, {"file_name": "2560 x 1440.png", "id": "1222877525073722", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982446_1222877528407055_8056433039736167714_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ky38wQXAupIQ7kNvwFkMItt&_nc_oc=AdnQgCkVV8cWNEk8asyoyNgbFpgguyqIdotjHBeNQV1uFBH9sxDlqmuaZNMmaSca-v4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu6J4mqnzRlbXh_DupUHa9vEoydqPbT0V03oqnhNPiX-g&oe=699C621C"}, {"file_name": "1440 x 1440.png", "id": "961925418233844", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036617_961925421567177_3841510894552774559_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2heJo8AddvgQ7kNvwEkQkcb&_nc_oc=Adkt9CjsPFldytFtpN-KzfbwlcGqC8GkmBFLmoymRrYPqlZ1oDzOywiaf6py3pZEiPI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftZl51AtyIye_XTeWIHbWmvjmb2zsKkoa35M1Y6WhP_2w&oe=699C39C5"}, {"file_name": "1080X360.png", "id": "715848710371996", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974523_715848713705329_284747130245148719_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xk6WCpp3TNgQ7kNvwEsBRyH&_nc_oc=AdlBNIf-ebw7